SUMMARY:Sebastian Cetina LIVE at Brea Improv
DTSTAMP:20260714T045139Z
DTSTART:20260715T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout Sebastian Cetina\nSebastian Cetina is 
	a uniquely gifted stand-up comedian\, host\, actor\, producer\, and impres
	sionist who has spent over 21 years proving himself as one of the funniest
	 and most versatile comedians in America. Sebastian headlines comedy clubs
	 and colleges all over the U.S. and has become one of the most exciting an
	d sought-after hosts in the business — currently serving as the host of Ca
	liente Mondays at the World Famous Laugh Factory in Hollywood. His comedy 
	style blends the character work of Eddie Murphy\, the loveable insults of 
	Don Rickles\, the improv genius of Robin Williams\, and the audience inter
	action of Andrew Dice Clay. He can perform 100+ different impressions\, or
	iginal characters\, and accents — from pop stars to presidents to cartoon 
	characters — making every show a completely unique experience. \nWhat to E
	xpect\nA Sebastian Cetina show is a non-stop\, high-energy comedy experien
	ce. Expect rapid-fire impressions\, hilarious characters\, and spontaneous
	 audience interaction that keeps the crowd roaring from start to finish. S
	ebastian is known for his ability to improvise an entire 90-minute show on
	 the spot\, reacting to the audience and the room in real time. His mass a
	ppeal means he can perform clean shows for all ages\, but at the Brea Impr
	ov (a 21+ venue)\, expect him to unleash his full\, unfiltered comedic ars
	enal. No two Sebastian Cetina shows are ever the same. \nAbout Brea Improv
	\nThe Brea Improv is one of Southern California’s premier comedy clubs\, l
	ocated at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA — just 30 miles southeast of downto
	wn Los Angeles. Part of the nationally renowned Improv Comedy Club chain\,
	 the Brea location features an intimate showroom with general admission se
	ating\, premium booths\, and a full food and beverage menu. The club has a
	 mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom\, making it a true d
	inner-and-a-show experience. With its cozy atmosphere and excellent sightl
	ines\, every seat feels close to the stage. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wedne
	sday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: B
	rea Improv\, 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nTick
	et Prices: $25 – $75 (plus fees)\n\nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains 
	affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttp
	s://comedycalendar.com/event/sebastian-cetina-live-at-brea-improv/\n\nFrom
	 Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sebastian-cetina-live-at-brea-improv/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United Sta
	tes
