DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJoey Aver
	y is a standout stand-up comedian celebrated for his sharp wit\, magnetic 
	stage presence\, and ability to connect with audiences through honest\, hi
	larious storytelling. His comedy draws from real-life experiences\, delive
	ring laughs with a warmth and authenticity that keeps crowds coming back f
	or more. \nAvery recently released his debut comedy special Live in San Fr
	ancisco\, which was met with widespread acclaim and introduced him to a na
	tional audience. His material is clever\, well-crafted\, and delivered wit
	h the kind of confident ease that only comes from years of honing his craf
	t on stages across the country. \nCatching Joey Avery live is a treat — hi
	s shows are energetic\, personal\, and packed with the kind of comedy that
	 leaves you quoting lines on the drive home. Don’t miss your chance to see
	 him at one of San Francisco’s premier comedy clubs. \nEvent Details\nDate
	: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026 (also Fri July 17 & Sat July 18)\nTime: 8:00 P
	M PDT (Thu) | 7:30 PM & 9:45 PM (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM (Sat)\nVenue: Pu
	nch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\
	, CA 94111\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range:
	 $32 – $52 \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is on
	e of the most legendary comedy venues in the country\, located at 444 Batt
	ery Street in the heart of the Financial District. Since opening in 1978\,
	 Punch Line has been the launching pad for some of the biggest names in co
	medy\, including Robin Williams\, Ellen DeGeneres\, and Jerry Seinfeld. \n
	The club seats approximately 300 guests in a cozy\, table-and-chair setup 
	that creates an intimate atmosphere perfect for stand-up comedy. A full ba
	r and food menu are available throughout the show\, and the staff is known
	 for their attentive\, friendly service. \nThe venue is conveniently locat
	ed near public transit and within walking distance of several parking gara
	ges. Whether you’re a first-time visitor or a regular\, Punch Line deliver
	s a world-class comedy experience every single night. \nWhat to Expect\nJo
	ey Avery performs multiple shows across the weekend of July 16–18\, giving
	 you several opportunities to catch this rising star live. Each show is a 
	full stand-up set featuring his best material\, delivered with the energy 
	and precision that has made him one of the most talked-about comedians on 
	the circuit. \nThe 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effec
	t for all shows. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime — 
	arrive early to secure a great seat and enjoy a pre-show drink. \nTicket I
	nformation\nPrice Range: $32 – $52 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are av
	ailable through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficia
	l TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn 
	a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/
