SUMMARY:D.L. Hughley LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260714T045139Z
DTSTART:20260717T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nD.L. Hugh
	ley is a comedy legend — one of the original Kings of Comedy and one of th
	e most respected voices in stand-up. With a career spanning more than thre
	e decades\, Hughley has built a reputation for fearless\, politically char
	ged comedy that tackles race\, culture\, and the absurdities of American l
	ife with razor-sharp wit and undeniable charisma. \nA bestselling author\,
	 radio host\, actor\, and activist\, D.L. Hughley brings far more than jus
	t jokes to the stage. His performances are part stand-up\, part social com
	mentary — deeply funny and deeply thought-provoking in equal measure. He h
	as released multiple acclaimed comedy specials and continues to tour relen
	tlessly\, delivering some of the most talked-about shows on the circuit. \
	nSeeing D.L. Hughley live is an experience unlike any other. His command o
	f the stage\, his ability to read a room\, and his fearless willingness to
	 go where other comedians won’t make every performance unforgettable. \nEv
	ent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026 (also Saturday\, July 18)\nTime
	: 7:00 PM & 9:30 PM PDT (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:30 PM PDT (Sat)\nVenue: Cobb’s
	 Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restric
	tion: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $40 – $70 \nAbout the 
	Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is San Francisco’s premier stand-up destination\
	, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the iconic North Beach neighborhood. W
	ith a capacity of around 400 guests\, Cobb’s offers an intimate setting wh
	ere every seat delivers a great view of the stage. \nThe club features a f
	ull bar and dining service\, with cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and food avail
	able throughout the show. The classic comedy club layout — tables and chai
	rs arranged around a central stage — creates a lively\, communal atmospher
	e that makes the laughs feel even bigger. \nCobb’s has hosted virtually ev
	ery major name in comedy over its storied history\, and its reputation as 
	one of the best rooms in the country is well-earned. Parking is available 
	in nearby garages\, and the venue is easily accessible by BART and Muni. \
	nWhat to Expect\nD.L. Hughley performs four shows across the weekend of Ju
	ly 17–18\, giving fans multiple opportunities to catch this comedy icon li
	ve. Each performance is a full stand-up set — sharp\, funny\, and unapolog
	etically honest — delivered by one of the greatest to ever do it. \nExpect
	 big laughs\, bold takes\, and the kind of comedy that stays with you long
	 after the show ends. The 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are i
	n effect. Arrive early to secure a great seat and enjoy a drink before the
	 show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $70 (before taxes a
	nd fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividS
	eats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affil
	iate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://c
	omedycalendar.com/event/dl-hughley-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Come
	dy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/dl-hughley-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, Califor
	nia\, 94133\, United States Of America
