SUMMARY:Andrew Dismukes LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DTSTAMP:20260714T045139Z
DTSTART:20260717T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dis
	mukes\nAndrew Dismukes is one of the most exciting comedians to emerge fro
	m the Saturday Night Live universe in recent years. A cast member on NBC’s
	 SNL since Season 46\, Dismukes first joined the show as a writer in Seaso
	n 43\, earning Emmy nominations for Outstanding Writing for a Variety Seri
	es in 2018 and 2019 before stepping in front of the camera as a featured p
	layer and later a repertory cast member. \nBefore SNL\, Dismukes honed his
	 stand-up chops at the University of Texas at Austin\, where he was the ru
	nner-up in the “Funniest Person in Austin” contest in 2016. His stand-up s
	tyle is sharp\, clever\, and deeply personal — blending absurdist observat
	ions with self-aware humor that showcases the same comedic instincts that 
	made him a standout on one of television’s most demanding stages. Seeing D
	ismukes perform live stand-up is a rare treat for fans who know him from T
	V. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors o
	pen approximately 30 minutes before showtime) \nVenue: Punch Line Philly —
	 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ even
	t with a 2-drink minimum \nTicket Prices: $32 – $72 (plus fees) \nAbout Pu
	nch Line Philly\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up come
	dy club\, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the vibrant Northern Liberties
	 neighborhood. The intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and is pu
	rpose-built to deliver the best possible comedy experience — every seat is
	 close to the stage\, and the energy in the room is electric from the mome
	nt the lights go down. \nThe club features a full bar and food service\, w
	ith a 2-drink minimum per guest. The layout ensures excellent sightlines f
	rom every seat\, and the warm\, lively atmosphere makes Punch Line Philly 
	the ideal setting for a world-class stand-up show. The venue has hosted so
	me of the biggest names in comedy and remains Philadelphia’s top destinati
	on for live laughs. \nParking is available in nearby lots and on surroundi
	ng streets. The venue is also accessible via SEPTA public transportation. 
	Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy a drink before the show. \nWha
	t to Expect\nAndrew Dismukes live is a treat for comedy fans of all kinds.
	 Whether you’ve followed his work on SNL or are discovering him for the fi
	rst time\, his stand-up set delivers the same sharp wit and comedic precis
	ion that has made him one of television’s most beloved performers. Expect 
	clever material\, great timing\, and the kind of performance that reminds 
	you why live comedy is so special. \nThis is a Friday night show — the per
	fect way to kick off the weekend with serious laughs. The intimate Punch L
	ine Philly setting means you’ll be up close with one of comedy’s brightest
	 rising stars. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $32 – $72 (plus applicab
	le fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and Vivid
	Seats (resale). Andrew Dismukes shows sell out fast — grab your seats now!
	 \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/andr
	ew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-phi
	lly/
