	nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nTicket Price: $37 – $42 \
	nAbout Aries Spears\nAries Spears is a veteran stand-up comedian and actor
	 best known for his long run on MADtv\, where his uncanny celebrity impres
	sions made him a household name. With decades of experience on stage and s
	creen\, Spears brings a high-energy\, no-holds-barred style to every perfo
	rmance. He has appeared on numerous TV specials and continues to tour nati
	onally to sold-out crowds. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy
	 from a MADtv legend\nHilarious celebrity impressions and sharp observatio
	nal humor\nAn intimate comedy club atmosphere at Omaha’s Funny Bone\nFull 
