SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at SAP Center at San J
	ose
DTSTAMP:20260714T045139Z
DTSTART:20260717T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNate Barg
	atze is one of the biggest names in stand-up comedy today — a clean\, fami
	ly-friendly comedian from Nashville\, Tennessee\, whose laid-back Southern
	 charm and masterful storytelling have made him a household name. Known as
	 “The Great Nate\,” Bargatze has sold out arenas across the country and ea
	rned a reputation as one of the most beloved live performers in the busine
	ss. \nHis comedy is warm\, relatable\, and brilliantly crafted — drawing f
	rom his life as a husband\, father\, and son of a clown (yes\, really). Na
	te’s specials on Netflix\, including The Greatest Average American and Hel
	lo World\, have introduced him to millions of fans worldwide and cemented 
	his status as a comedy superstar. \nThe Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is Bargat
	ze’s most ambitious tour yet\, bringing his signature brand of wholesome\,
	 hilarious comedy to arenas across the globe. This is a rare chance to see
	 one of comedy’s biggest stars in the Bay Area — don’t miss it. \nEvent De
	tails\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT\nVenue: SAP Center
	 at San Jose\, 525 W Santa Clara St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nTicket Price Ra
	nge: $65 – $150 \nAbout the Venue\nSAP Center at San Jose is one of the pr
	emier entertainment arenas in the Bay Area\, located at 525 W Santa Clara 
	Street in downtown San Jose. With a capacity of approximately 17\,500 for 
	concerts and events\, SAP Center is home to the San Jose Sharks NHL team a
	nd hosts some of the biggest touring acts in the world. \nThe arena featur
	es state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, multiple concession areas
	\, full bar service\, and a variety of seating options from floor-level to
	 upper bowl. Parking is available in several nearby garages and surface lo
	ts\, and the venue is conveniently located near the SAP Center Light Rail 
	station for easy public transit access. \nSeeing Nate Bargatze at SAP Cent
	er means experiencing his comedy at full arena scale — a massive productio
	n with incredible energy from thousands of fans all laughing together. It’
	s a truly special experience. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Big Dumb Eyes World To
	ur is a full arena stand-up show featuring Nate Bargatze’s best new materi
	al alongside fan favorites. Expect a polished\, high-production performanc
	e with Bargatze’s signature storytelling style — slow-burn setups\, perfec
	tly timed punchlines\, and the kind of wholesome humor that appeals to aud
	iences of all ages. \nThis is an all-ages show\, making it a perfect night
	 out for the whole family. Doors typically open 60–90 minutes before showt
	ime. Arrive early to find your seats and grab concessions before the show 
	begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $65 – $150 (before taxes and fe
	es)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats 
	(resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate 
	links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedy
	calendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at-sap-cent
	er-at-san-jose/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour
	-live-at-sap-center-at-san-jose/
LOCATION:SAP Center at San Jose\, 525 W Santa Clara St\, San Jose\, Califor
	nia\, 95113\, United States
