SUMMARY:Lucas Zelnick LIVE at Music Box at the Borgata
DTSTAMP:20260714T045139Z
DTSTART:20260717T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nLucas Zelnick LIVE at Music Box at the Borgata\nNe
	w York City’s sharpest rising stand-up comedian\, Lucas Zelnick\, brings h
	is meticulously crafted\, punch-heavy comedy to the intimate Music Box at 
	the Borgata in Atlantic City for one unforgettable night on Friday\, July 
	17\, 2026. Known for his viral crowd interactions and razor-sharp material
	\, Zelnick is one of the most exciting voices in comedy today — and this A
	tlantic City show is a rare chance to see him in an intimate venue setting
	. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM ET\nVenue:
	 Music Box at the Borgata\nAddress: One Borgata Way\, Atlantic City\, NJ 0
	8401\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nParking: Available at Borgata Hot
	el Casino & Spa parking facilities \nAbout Lucas Zelnick\nLucas Zelnick is
	 a New York City-born stand-up comedian whose sharp\, punch-heavy material
	 playfully interrogates his Upper East Side upbringing. After graduating f
	rom Williams College and earning an MBA from Stanford\, he co-founded Sesh
	 Comedy on the Lower East Side before selling it to tour nationally. His v
	iral clips spotlight nimble crowd interactions\, yet his shows lean on met
	iculously built jokes and a clear comedic point of view. Zelnick has been 
	featured on Comedy Central Stand-Up Featuring and Don’t Tell Comedy\, and 
	regularly appears at the Comedy Cellar while headlining theaters and clubs
	 across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, punch-heavy stand-up come
	dy with a clear point of view\nHilarious crowd interaction and spontaneous
	 moments\nMaterial drawn from his unique Upper East Side upbringing and St
	anford MBA background\nAn intimate Music Box setting that puts you close t
	o the action\nOne of comedy’s fastest-rising headliners at the peak of his
	 game\nA full evening of non-stop laughs in Atlantic City’s premier comedy
	 venue\n\nVenue Information\nThe Music Box at the Borgata is Atlantic City
	’s premier intimate entertainment venue\, located inside the world-class B
	orgata Hotel Casino & Spa at One Borgata Way. With a capacity of approxima
	tely 1\,000 guests\, the Music Box offers an up-close and personal experie
	nce that larger arenas simply can’t match. The venue features excellent si
	ghtlines\, top-tier sound and lighting\, and easy access to Borgata’s awar
	d-winning restaurants and casino floor. \nTicket Information\nTickets for 
	Lucas Zelnick at Music Box at the Borgata start from $231 on resale market
	s. Official tickets are available through Ticketmaster. Secure your seats 
	early — this intimate venue fills up fast for top comedy headliners. \nOff
	icial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We ear
	n a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost 
	to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo I
	D may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/lucas-zel
	nick-live-at-music-box-at-the-borgata/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/lucas-zelnick-live-at-music-box-at-the
	-borgata/
